+++ b/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
@@ -458,3 +458,20 @@ rows, and the AFD attention node reads it before the expert wire opens; the expe
 slots off the settings handshake's `prefill_rows` as before, and an MCDMA mailbox too small for a chunk is refused at
